# The DDF sources go into the built zip byte for byte (tools/build-ddf.js),
# and that build is only deterministic if a clone reproduces those bytes
# exactly. Line-ending translation on the way in or out would make the same
# source build a different DDF on a different machine, --check would report
# stale on a clean tree, and the designer would ship a zip that no longer
# matches what this app declares.
ddf-source/** -text
